<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3339871918478121279..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: He Wouldn&#39;t Back Down: The Bittersweet Victory of Brian McNelis </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>10</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-382204917813012550</id><published>2015-11-28T21:17:27.927-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-28T21:17:27.927-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The people closest to Mr. McNelis -- his daughter ...</title><content type='html'>The people closest to Mr. McNelis -- his daughter and his wife -- believed he was innocent. As explained above, his daughter was abducted by authorities after the charges were filed and McNelis was threatened with a felony prosecution if he defended his parental rights during the emergency shelter hearing. Even if he had been a drug dealer -- something the Ada County Sheriff and Prosecutor failed entirely to prove -- the treatment inflicted on McNelis and his family would have to be regarded as abominable.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As someone who has never used drugs and does not intend to do so in the future, I would far rather take my chances with narco-entrepreneurs than with armed enforcers of prohibition. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/382204917813012550'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/382204917813012550'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1448770647927#c382204917813012550' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 28, 2015 at 9:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6451502440934506293</id><published>2015-11-28T20:47:47.375-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-28T20:47:47.375-07:00</updated><title type='text'>So people CLOSE to you believe you&amp;#39;re a drug d...</title><content type='html'>So people CLOSE to you believe you&amp;#39;re a drug dealer because...? I don&amp;#39;t get it.  I&amp;#39;m pretty sure they never take away parent visitation rights no matter what you do.  He never exercised them or what?  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/6451502440934506293'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/6451502440934506293'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1448768867375#c6451502440934506293' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-432928186"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 28, 2015 at 8:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-532084184337999988</id><published>2015-09-28T06:14:41.043-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-28T06:14:41.043-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Your tax dollars could not bury the lies but the g...</title><content type='html'>Your tax dollars could not bury the lies but the government lawyers did get the jury to disrespect the victim as a person. Likely with having the jury believing he had it coming anyway, regardless that the cops lied. If so, that had nothing to do with the case and is a complete scam, that he is personally a bad guy whom deserved whatever came his way. By allowing that kind of defence by the defendants at the trial, the judge went along with fraud upon the court. He&amp;#39;s still a crime victim yet again by having suffered more crimes against him by the state. The jury agreed that he was a crime victim, but the jury was toyed with to a point that they disrespected him with contempt. The trial was a fraud.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/532084184337999988'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/532084184337999988'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1443442481043#c532084184337999988' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1252140761"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 28, 2015 at 6:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4784034470991199090</id><published>2015-09-28T05:56:43.789-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-28T05:56:43.789-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Many times when juries award too much the case goe...</title><content type='html'>Many times when juries award too much the case goes back to court over that amount. This should be too easy for any lawyer to step in and help this guy out to get a just award. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4784034470991199090'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4784034470991199090'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1443441403789#c4784034470991199090' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1252140761"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 28, 2015 at 5:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3948668086524831748</id><published>2015-09-23T04:11:45.026-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-23T04:11:45.026-06:00</updated><title type='text'>In a just society this criminal cop should be faci...</title><content type='html'>In a just society this criminal cop should be facing the death penalty for these especially egregious crimes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/3948668086524831748'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/3948668086524831748'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1443003105026#c3948668086524831748' title=''/><author><name>InalienableWrights</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02108700971976990644</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='21' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_MknTgiDcOKU/Sbq4HYqLYUI/AAAAAAAAEok/Gy3CCv4L1xI/S220/constitution.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1008395888"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 23, 2015 at 4:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8605576948326098764</id><published>2015-09-22T23:16:42.388-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-22T23:16:42.388-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When injustice in the courts prevail, it is only a...</title><content type='html'>When injustice in the courts prevail, it is only a matter of time before people will seek recourse in the form of &amp;quot;street justice&amp;quot;.  Look at what happened to the police in Romania after the fall of the Communist government....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/8605576948326098764'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/8605576948326098764'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1442985402388#c8605576948326098764' title=''/><author><name>PaulTheCabDriver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1748911829"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 22, 2015 at 11:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1997090814868240477</id><published>2015-09-22T13:44:57.580-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-22T13:44:57.580-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Looks like the Judge was the only one who gave a s...</title><content type='html'>Looks like the Judge was the only one who gave a shit, besides McNelis.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/1997090814868240477'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/1997090814868240477'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1442951097580#c1997090814868240477' title=''/><author><name>mike m</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03127409540797668035</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262413841"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 22, 2015 at 1:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725779141911384827</id><published>2015-09-22T12:32:58.253-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-22T12:32:58.253-06:00</updated><title type='text'>A civil award would have been paid by the tax vict...</title><content type='html'>A civil award would have been paid by the tax victims residing within Ada County, not by the offenders -- who had no skin in the game, as it were. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ada County spent a huge sum and deployed a platoon of attorneys in an attempt to defeat McNelis in court. He took them on and beat them soundly. Irrespective of the size of the award, that outcome is a straight-up win by any honest reckoning. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4725779141911384827'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4725779141911384827'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1442946778253#c4725779141911384827' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 22, 2015 at 12:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2142806289884495057</id><published>2015-09-22T12:19:58.713-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-22T12:19:58.713-06:00</updated><title type='text'>1 dollar?! That&amp;#39;s hardly &amp;quot;kicked their as...</title><content type='html'> 1 dollar?! That&amp;#39;s hardly &amp;quot;kicked their ass.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/2142806289884495057'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/2142806289884495057'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1442945998713#c2142806289884495057' title=''/><author><name>Truthblog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07961839596417657105</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-909122700"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 22, 2015 at 12:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4790162562841769743</id><published>2015-09-21T18:42:50.274-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-21T18:42:50.274-06:00</updated><title type='text'>the reason things are as they unfolded in this cas...</title><content type='html'>the reason things are as they unfolded in this case is demonstrated by the jury outcome:  they couldn&amp;#39;t ignore the facts, but, regardless, sided with the cops by the award.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the salient point is the jury SIDED with the cops by their award and that is why the abuse continues - too many let them get away with it.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4790162562841769743'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3339871918478121279/comments/default/4790162562841769743'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html?showComment=1442882570274#c4790162562841769743' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/he-wouldnt-back-down-bittersweet.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3339871918478121279' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3339871918478121279' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1879674584"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 21, 2015 at 6:42 PM"/></entry></feed>